{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123461","id":4517627520,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDUWGgA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123461","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123461.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123461.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123461","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123461/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123461/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123461/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c2e13e919732c43231cd7e6a68f5d505f92b9977","number":123461,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix to NoiseTexture2D to immediately generate a texture on get_image()","user":{"login":"moonpirates","id":70726098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzI2MDk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70726098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates","html_url":"https://github.com/moonpirates","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonpirates/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The problem with `NoiseTexture2D` was that its virtual `get_image()` method returned `nullptr` because the actual generation of the noise texture happened at a later point. I took the approach from `GradientTexture1D`/`GradientTexture2D`, where it first checks if generation is queued, and in that case immediately forces generation of the texture. `NoiseTexture2D` also uses threaded generation, so that made this class a bit more complex.  The class now solely relies on the RS version of the texture.\r\n\r\n**The biggest risk I think this PR introduces** is that `_set_texture_image()` no longer calls `emit_changed()`, because I made the method `const`. I rather introduced `emit_changed()` to all the public setter methods, like `GradientTexture1D`/`GradientTexture2D` do. I think this should be enough, but I'd appreciate a second pair of eyes there.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123308\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI used.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4